   "body": "**Capture result** (PR #435, 2026-11-02): `R97a`. `/.well-known/apple-app-site-association` answers 200 `application/json` (Last-Modified 12 May 2025), old format: one `applinks.details` entry, appID `QMG83DG7YP.hfrplus.red.super`, paths `/`, `/hfr/*`, `/forum2.php*`; `webcredentials.apps` = the same App ID. Universal links and shared web credentials therefore only serve that legacy App ID (FEAT-020 #164, Q-1). Recorded in HFR-PROTOCOL §6c LOT-095.",
